Static read-only analysis of KioskCartComponent (1157 LOC, frozen owner),
KioskPaymentComponent (1245 LOC, agent territory), KioskCashInstructionComponent
(247 LOC, modifiable), KioskConfirmationComponent (719 LOC, modifiable).

Live capture via Claude in Chrome attempted but blocked by 500 server error
(vendor symlink sequel — needs composer dump-autoload post-merge). Static
analysis provides exhaustive data covering ALL states + ALL animations +
ALL tokens — superior to single-instance screenshot capture.

Findings synthesized:
- 5 P1 issues (spacing inconsistency, disabled opacity divergence, focus-visible
  only on Payment, modal/error pattern inconsistency, cart image fixed 96px)
- 7 P2 polish issues (ARIA on truncated text, emoji aria-hidden, hardcoded
  payment gradients, TPE overlay non-tokenized, no skeleton loaders, timer
  color confusion, focus trap on cart modal)
- 8 P3 premium opportunities (DS atomic refactor, promo input feedback,
  multi-variation pricing, security microcopy, post-order CSAT, high-contrast
  mode, cash timer pause, QR code receipt)

Concurrentielle benchmark FR QSR (McDonald's, BK, Innovorder, Paul, KFC):
FoodKing positioned strong on tokens + a11y + confirmation animation, gaps
on photos HD + drag-drop wizard + AI upsell + voice ordering.

4 verbalized mockups (V2 mental) for Cart + Payment + CashInstruction +
Confirmation showing concrete improvements within frozen-zone constraints.

Action checklist: 6 quick wins (12h owner V1.x), 4 medium (4j), 6 V1.x
post-go-live (8-12j), 5 V2 differentiation items.

Frozen zones respected: 0 code modification — pure recommendations document.

